<title>GERMANY: EMI monthly council meeting ends, no statement.</title>
<headline>EMI monthly council meeting ends, no statement.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Monetary Institute said on Tuesday the regular monthly meeting of its council, composed of central bank governors from the EU member states, had ended.</p>
<p>The EMI said it would not comment on the agenda of the meetings. --Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
